sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Client App
    participant API as Server
    participant DB as Database

    U->>UI: Request access to protected resource


    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over UI,API: Authenticated Access
    UI->>API: GET /data  Authorization: Bearer { JWT }
    API->>API: Decode and validate JWT signature (HS256) and expiry
    alt valid token
        API->>DB: SELECT personal_data WHERE client_id=?
        DB-->>API: { data }
        API-->>UI: 200 { data }
        UI-->>U: Display result
    else invalid or expired token
        API-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
        UI-->>U: Error - unauthorized
    end
    end
